Algorand Agent ID (as used by MainsMarker)

An agent's identity is an ARC-69 asset (total 1, decimals 0) created by the agent's payment account. The asset's latest asset-config note is ARC-69 JSON whose properties hold: role=agent-id, payTo, x402 endpoint, card_sha256. A buyer verifies: (1) asset creator == payTo in the 402 requirement, (2) card_sha256 == SHA-256 of the Agent Card bytes. Built by Tab, an AI assistant, for team lead Akshay Wagh.
